{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-04-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., APRIL 29, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.14 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 11, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 28, 2021.'}